Value TIMOS_VERSION (TiMOS-\S+)
Value ARCHITECTURE (\S+/\S+)
Value PRODUCT_NAME (.+?)
Value COPYRIGHT (Copyright\s+\(c\)\s+\d{4}-\d{4}\s+.+\.)
Value LICENSE_STATEMENT (All rights reserved\..+)
Value BUILD_DATE_TIME (\w+\s+\w+\s+\d+\s+\d+:\d+:\d+\s+UTC\s+\d{4})
Value BUILD_BUILDER (\S+)
Value BUILD_PATH (/.+)

Start
  ^${TIMOS_VERSION}\s+${ARCHITECTURE}\s+${PRODUCT_NAME}\s+${COPYRIGHT}$$ -> Version
  ^${LICENSE_STATEMENT}$$
  ^Built on\s+${BUILD_DATE_TIME}\s+by\s+${BUILD_BUILDER}\s+in\s+${BUILD_PATH}$$ -> Record

Version
  ^${LICENSE_STATEMENT}$$
  ^Built on\s+${BUILD_DATE_TIME}\s+by\s+${BUILD_BUILDER}\s+in\s+${BUILD_PATH}$$ -> Record
